      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine the crispy rice cereal and the walnuts in a large bowl. Stir in the date mixture; mix well.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Working quickly, form the cereal and date mixture into 1 inch balls. Roll balls in coconut. Store in an airtight container in a cool place. Do not refrigerate.",
